STEP 17 Configure Jenkins-----
Open Jenkins in your browser.
Click New Item.
Enter React-CICD as the name.
Select Pipeline.
Click OK.
Under Pipeline, choose Pipeline script from SCM.
Select Git.
Enter your GitHub repository URL.
Branch: main
Script Path: Jenkinsfile
Click Save.
Build now 

